Runtest for fsm blocks in .comp files (docs/dev/MODCOMPILE_FSM_DESIGN.md): an io state_var taken over on the first run (a valid value restores the state with its timer at 0 and on_enter pending; an invalid one starts in the initial state) and written every run afterwards, so writes from outside have no effect, also not after a reset; output blocks running while the fsm is disabled or in reset (the initial state's), during not; <fsm>_reset_outputs() from user code; an out pin in inputs.
